@OrderPortal_HostAddress = https://localhost:7242
@productId = 1

### 1. Create a New Order
POST {{OrderPortal_HostAddress}}/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 2. Get Order by ID (Replace the GUID below with the ID returned from the POST response)
GET {{OrderPortal_HostAddress}}/order/1
Accept: application/json